       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Total daily dose:** 1700 mg three times daily is 5,100 mg/day. The usual maximum for metformin is 2,550 mg/day for immediate-release (2,000 mg/day for extended-release in the US).\n- **Single dose:** 1,700 mg is well above the usual maximum of about 1,000 mg per dose. The risks are GI toxicity and lactic acidosis.\n\nPossible intended orders:\n- 850 mg PO three times daily with meals (2,550 mg/day, the max dose)\n- 1,700 mg total per day, for example 850 mg twice daily with meals\n- 500 mg or 1,000 mg PO twice daily with meals\n\nPlease tell me which dose you want, or confirm that 1,700 mg three times daily is intended. If you confirm it, I'll enter it with a note recording that you verified the dose."
